# Human-edited dependency source. Pinned, reproducible versions are frozen into
# requirements.txt by `make install` (pip install -r requirements.in then freeze).
#
# crewai owns the shared/transitive heavy deps (chromadb, pydantic, openai via
# litellm, opentelemetry). We pin ONLY crewai + crewai-tools and let pip resolve
# the rest to compatible versions, then lock the exact set in requirements.txt.

# ---- Core framework ----
crewai==1.14.6
crewai-tools==1.14.6

# ---- API ----
fastapi
uvicorn[standard]
python-multipart

# ---- Config / validation ----
pydantic-settings
python-dotenv

# ---- RAG: embeddings + vector stores (chromadb comes via crewai) ----
sentence-transformers
pinecone

# ---- Storage ----
SQLAlchemy

# ---- Resilience ----
tenacity

# ---- Tests ----
pytest
httpx

# ---- Observability (OPTIONAL): install separately to avoid OTel pin clashes ----
# pip install langfuse
